hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1916","[AI-translation] ´Burda kehtay hain ke` mein ne Agharr raziyallahu anhu se suna aur wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahaba mein se thay wo bayan kartay hain ke Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ae logon ! Allah ki taraf tauba karo kyunke mein Allah Taala se har din mein sau baar tauba karta hun "
"1917","[AI-translation] ´Haris bin Suwaid kehtay hain ke` Abdullah (bin Mas'ud) raziyallahu anhu beemar thay to mein un ki iyadat ko un ke paas gaya unhon ne mujh se do hadeesein bayan kein aik apni taraf se aur aik Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf se unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke albatta Allah Taala apne momin banda ki tauba se us se zyada khush hota hai jaisay koi apni sawaari par ke jis par us ke khanay peenay ki ashya bhi hun aik halaakat khaiz sunsaan jungle mein jaye (jahan na saya ho na pani ho) aur wo (aaraam ke liye) sau jaye jab wo jagay to us ki sawaari kahein ja chuki ho phir us ko dhoonday yahan tak ke usay sakht pyaas lag jaye phir (maayoos ho kar) kahay ke mein laut jaun jahan tha aur sotay sotay mar jaun (kyunke bachao ki koi soorat nazar nahi aati) phir apna sar apne baazu par rakhay aur marnay ke liye lait jaye phir jo jagay to apni sawaari apne paas paye aur us par us ka tosha ho khana bhi aur pani bhi Allah Taala ko momin banday ki tauba se us se kahein zyada khushi hoti hai jitni us shakhs ko apne oont aur tosha ke milnay se hoti hai "
"1918","[AI-translation] ´bin Shihab rahimahullah Allah kehtay hain ke` phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Tabook ka jihad kiya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka irada Room aur shaam ke Arab Nasraanion ke khilaf jihad ka tha bin Shihab ne kaha ke mujhe Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Ka'b bin Maalik ne khabar di ke Abdullah bin Ka'b jo ke Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ki nabina ho janay ki bina par raahnumaayi kiya kartay thay ne kaha ke Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ko mein ne apne ghazwa Tabook se peechay reh janay ka waqia bayan kartay hue suna Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein ghazwa Tabook ke ilawa kisi ghazwa mein peechay nahi raha albatta ghazwa Badr mein bhi peechay reh gaya tha lekin us mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kisi peechay reh janay walay par narazgi ka izhaar nahi kiya aur Badr mein to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Musalmanon ke saath Quraish ka qaafila lautnay ke liye niklay thay lekin Allah Taala ne Musalmanon ko un ke dushmanon ke saath achanak lara diya (aur qaafila nikal gaya) aur mein Rasoolullah ke saath Lailat-ul-Aqaba mein bhi maujood tha (Lailat-ul-Aqaba wo raat hai jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ansaar se Islam par aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki madad karnay par bai'at li thi aur ye bai'at Jamrat-ul-Aqaba ke paas jo Mina mein hai dobaar hui pehli baar mein baara Ansari thay aur doosri baar mein satr Ansari thay) aur mein nahi chahta ke us raat ke badlay mein jang Badr mein shareek hota agarchay jang Badr logon mein us raat se zyada mashhoor hai (yani log us ko afzal kehtay hain) aur ghazwa Tabook mein mera peechay reh janay ka qissa ye hai ke us ghazwa ke waqt mein mein jitna qawi jawan aur khushhaal tha us se pehle kabhi na tha Allah ki qasam ! us se pehle mere paas do oontniyan kabhi jama nahi huein thin aur us larai ke waqt mere paas do oontniyan thin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us larai ke liye sakht garmi ke dinon mein chalay aur safar bhi lamba tha aur raah mein jungle thay (door lambi jin mein pani kam milta aur halaakat ka khauf hota hai) aur bohat saaray dushmanon se muqabla tha us liye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Musalmanon se saaf saaf farmaya diya ke mein us larai ke liye ja raha hun (halanke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ye aadat thi ke aur laraion mein apna irada maslihat ke tehat saaf saaf na farmatay thay taake khabar mashhoor na ho) taake wo apni tayyari kar lein un se keh diya ke falan taraf ko jana hai aur us waqt Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath bohat se Musalman thay aur koi register na tha jis mein un ke naam likhe ja saktay Ka'b ne kaha ke bohat kam koi aisa shakhs ho ga jo ye gumaan kar ke us ghazwa se ghaib honay ka irada karay ke us ka muamla jab tak wahi na aaye gi makhfi rahay ga aur ye jihad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us waqt kiya jab phal pak gaye thay aur saya khoob tha aur mujhe un cheezon ka bohat shauq tha aakhir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne tayyari ki aur Musalmanon ne bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath tayyari ki mein ne bhi har subah ko us irada se nikalna shuru kiya ke mein bhi un ke saath tayyari karun lekin mein har roz laut aata aur kuch faisla na karta aur apne dil mein kehta ke mein jab chahun ja sakta hun (kyunke safar ka samaan mere paas maujood tha) mein yehi sochta raha hatta ke Musalmanon ne samaan safar tayyar kar liya aur aik subah Rasoolullah Musalmanon ko saath le kar nikal paray aur mein ne koi tayyari na ki phir mein subah ko nikla aur laut kar aa gaya aur koi faisla nahi kar paya mera yehi haal raha yahan tak ke logon ne jaldi ki aur sab mujaahideen aagay nikal gaye us waqt mein ne bhi kooch ka qasd kiya ke un se mil jaun Ae Kaash mein aisa karta lekin meri taqdeer mein na tha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke janay ke baad jab mein bahar nikalta to mujhe ranj hota kyunke mein koi pairwi ke laiq na pata magar aisa shakhs jis par munafiq honay ka gumaan tha ya mazoor zaeef aur naatawan logon mein se khair Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne (raah mein) meri yaad kahein na ki yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Tabook mein pahunche Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam logon mein baithay hue thay ke us waqt farmaya Ka'b bin Maalik kahan gaya Bani Salama mein se aik shakhs bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! us ko us ki chaadron ne rok liya hai wo apne donon kinaron ko dekhta hai (yani apne libaas aur nafs mein mashghool aur masroof hai) Muaz bin Jabal raziyallahu anhu ne ye sun kar kaha ke to ne buri baat kahi Allah ki qasam ! Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham to Ka'b bin Maalik ko acha samajhtay hain Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ye sun kar chup ho rahay itnay mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik shakhs ko dekha jo safed kapray pehnay hue aa raha tha aur (chalnay ki wajah se) rait ko ura raha tha jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo Abu Khaisama hai phir wo Abu Khaisama hi tha aur Abu Khaisama wo shakhs tha jis ne aik sa khajoor sadqa di thi aur munafiqon ne us par taan kiya tha Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Tabook se Madina ki taraf laut rahay hain to mera ranj barh gaya mein ne jhoot baatein banana shuru kein ke koi baat aisi kahun jis se kal (yani Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wapasi par) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki narazgi se bach jaun aur us muamla ke liye mein ne apne ghar walon mein se har aik aqalmand shakhs se madad lena shuru ki yani un se bhi salaah li (ke kiya baat banaon) jab logon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam qareeb aa pahunche to us waqt saara jhoot kafoor ho gaya aur mein samajh gaya ke ab mein koi jhoot bana kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se nijaat nahi paa sakta aakhir mein ne sach bolnay ki niyyat kar li aur subah ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab safar se aatay to pehle masjid mein jatay aur do rakat namaz padhtay phir logon se milnay ke liye baithtay jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ye kar chukay to jo log peechay reh gaye thay unhon ne apne uzr bayan karnay shuru kiye aur qasamein khanay lagay ye log usi (80) se kuch zyada thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ki zaahir baat ko maan liya aur un se bai'at ki aur un ke liye maghfirat ki dua ki aur un ki niyyat (yani dil ki baat ko) Allah ke supurd kar diya jab mein aaya pas mein ne salam kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam muskuraye lekin us tarah jaisay koi ghussa ki haalat mein muskurata hai phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aao mein chalta hua aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay baith gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to peechay kyun reh gaya to ne to sawaari bhi khareed li thi mein ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! agar mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke siwa duniya ke shakhson mein se kisi aur ke paas baitha hota to mein ye khayal karta ke koi uzr bayan kar ke us ke ghussa se nikal jaun ga aur mujhe Allah Taala ne zubaan ki quwwat di hai (yani mein umda taqreer kar sakta hun aur khoob baat bana sakta hun) lekin Allah ki qasam ! mein janta hun ke agar mein koi jhoot baat Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se keh dun aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mujh se khush ho jayein ge to qareeb hai ke Allah Taala Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko mere upar ghussa kar de ga (yani Allah Taala Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko batlaye ga ke mera uzr jhoot aur ghalat tha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam naraaz ho jayein ge) aur agar mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se sach sach kahun ga to beshak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ghussay hun ge lekin mujhe umeed hai ke Allah Taala us ka anjaam bakhair karay ga Allah ki qasam ! jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se peechay reh gaya us waqt mujhe koi uzr na tha Allah ki qasam mein kabhi na itna qawi aur itna maaldaar na tha jitna us waqt tha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ka'b ne sach kaha phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke acha ja yahan tak ke Allah Taala tere baaray mein faisla kar de mein khara ho gaya aur Bani Salama ke chand log daur kar mere peechay hue aur mujh se kehnay lagay ke Allah ki qasam ! ham nahi jantay ke tum ne us se pehle koi qasoor kiya ho pas tum aajiz kyun ho gaye aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay koi uzr kyun na kar diya jis tarah aur peechay reh janay walon ne uzr bayan kiye aur tera gunah bakhshwaanay ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka istighfar kaafi hota Allah ki qasam wo log mujhe malamat kartay rahay yahan tak ke mein ne irada kiya ke phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas laut kar jaun aur apne Aap ko jhoota karun (aur koi uzr bayan karun) phir mein ne un logon se kaha ke kisi aur ka bhi aisa haal hua hai jo mera hua hai unhon ne kaha ke haan ! do shakhs aisay aur hain unhon ne bhi wohi kaha jo to ne kaha aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un se bhi wohi farmaya jo tujh se farmaya mein ne poocha ke wo do shakhs kaun hain unhon ne kaha ke Maraara bin Rabia aur Hilaal bin Umayya waaqifi un logon ne aisay do shakhson ke naam liye jo naik thay Badr ki larai mein maujood thay aur pairwi ke qaabil thay jab un logon ne un donon ka naam liya to mein apne pehle haal par qaim raha aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Musalmanon ko peechay reh janay walay ham teenon se baat cheet karnay se mana kar diya to logon ne ham se parhaiz shuru kiya aur un ka haal hamaray saath bilkul badal gaya yahan tak ke zameen bhi goya badal gayi wo zameen hi na rahi jis ko mein pehchanta tha pachaas raaton tak hamara yehi haal raha mere donon saathi to aajiz ho gaye aur apne gharon mein rotay hue baith rahay lekin mein to sab logon mein naujawan aur taaqatwar tha mein nikla karta tha aur namaz ke liye bhi aata aur bazaaron mein bhi phirta lekin koi shakhs mujh se baat na karta aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab namaz se farigh ho kar apni jagah par baithay hotay to aa kar un ko salam karta aur dil mein ye kehta ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne labon ko salam ka jawab denay ke liye hilaya ya nahi hilaya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke qareeb namaz padhta aur chor nazar se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekhta to jab mein namaz mein hota to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam meri taraf dekhtay aur jab mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf dekhta to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam munh pher letay hatta ke jab Musalmanon ki sakhti mujh par lambi hui to mein chala aur Qatada raziyallahu anhu ke baagh ki deewar par charha aur Qatada mere chachazaad bhai thay aur sab logon se zyada mujhe un se mohabbat thi un ko salam kiya to Allah ki qasam unhon ne salam ka jawab tak na diya (SubhanAllah Allah Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke taabe aisay hotay hain ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke irshaad ke saamnay bhai betay ki parwa bhi nahi kartay jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aisi mohabbat na ho to iman kis kaam ka hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hadees jab maloom ho jaye ke sahih hai to mujtahid aur maulviyon ka qaul jo us ke khilaf ho deewar par maarna chahiye aur hadees par chalna chahiye) mein ne un se kaha ke Ae Qatada ! mein tumhein Allah ki qasam deta hun ke tum ye nahi jantay ke mein Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah usay mohabbat rakhta hun wo khamosh rahay mein ne dobara un se sawal kiya wo phir khamosh rahay mein ne phir teesri baar qasam di to bolay ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob jantay hain (ye bhi Ka'b se nahi bolay balke khud apne mein baat ki) aakhir meri aankhon se aansu nikal paray aur mein peeth mor kar chala aur deewar par charha mein Madina ke bazaar mein ja raha tha ke mulk shaam ke kisaanon mein se aik kisaan jo Madina mein anaaj baichnay ke liye aaya tha keh raha tha ke Ka'b bin Maalik ka ghar mujhe kaun bataye ga logon ne us ko meri taraf ishara shuru kiya yahan tak ke wo mere paas aaya aur mujhe Ghassaan ke baadshah ka aik khat diya mein chunke padh sakta tha mein ne us ko padha to us mein ye likha tha ke amma baad ! ” hamein ye khabar pahunchi hai ke tumharay saahib (yani Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tum par naraaz hue hain aur Allah Taala ne tumhein zillat ke ghar mein nahi kiya na us jagah jahan tumhara haq zaya ho to tum ham se mil jao ham tumhari khaatir daari karein ge “ mein ne jab ye khat padha to kaha ke ye bhi Allah ki taraf se aik aazmaish hai aur us khat ko mein ne tanoor mein jala diya jab pachaas mein se chaalees din guzar gaye aur wahi na aayi to yakayak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka paigham lanay wala mere paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tumhein hukm kartay hain ke apni bi bi se alehda raho mein ne kaha ke us ko talaqein dey doon ya kiya karun wo bola ke nahi talaqein mat do sirf alag raho aur us se sohbat mat karo mere donon saathiyon (jo peechay reh gaye thay) ko bhi yehi paigham mila mein ne apni biwi se kaha ke to apne azeezon mein chali ja aur wahein reh yahan tak ke Allah Taala us baaray mein koi faisla de Hilaal bin Umayya raziyallahu anhu ki biwi ye sun kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas gayi aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Hilaal bin Umayya aik boorha kamzor shakhs hai us ke paas koi khadim bhi nahi to kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bura samajhtay hain ke agar mein us ki khidmat kiya karun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein khidmat ko bura nahi samajhta lekin wo tujh se sohbat na karay wo boli ke Allah ki qasam ! us ko kisi kaam ka khayal nahi aur Allah ki qasam ! wo us din se ab tak ro raha hai mere ghar walon ne kaha ke Kaash tum bhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se apni biwi ke paas rehnay ki ijazat le lo kyunke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hilaal bin Umayya ki aurat ko us ki khidmat karnay ki ijazat de di to mein ne kaha ke mein kabhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se apni biwi ke liye ijazat na lun ga aur maloom nahi ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kiya farmayein ge agar mein apni biwi ke liye ijazat lun aur mein jawan aadmi hun phir mein das raatein usi haal mein raha yahan tak ke us tareekh se pachaas raatein poori huein jab se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham se sab logon ko baat karnay se mana farmaya tha phir pachaaswein raat ko subah ke waqt mein ne apne aik ghar ki chhat par namaz padhi mein usi haal mein baitha tha jo Allah Taala ne hamara haal bayan kiya ke mera ji tang ho gaya aur zameen apni faraakhi ke bawajood mujh par tang ho gayi thi itnay mein mein ne aik pukaarnay walay ki aawaz suni jo Sala' (naami) pahar par se buland aawaz se pukaar raha tha ke Ae Ka'b bin Maalik ! khush ho ja ye sun kar mein sajda mein gira aur mein ne pehchana ke ab kushaadgi aa gayi phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne subah ki namaz ke baad us baat ka ailaan kiya ke Allah Taala ne hamari tauba qabool kar li hai log hamein khushkhabri denay ko chalay mere donon saathiyon ke paas chand khushkhabri denay walay gaye aur aik shakhs ne mere paas ghora dauraya aur aik daurnay wala Aslam qabeela se meri taraf aaya aur us ki aawaz ghoray se jaldi mujh ko pahunchi jab wo shakhs aaya jis ki khushkhabri ki aawaz mein ne suni thi to mein ne apne donon kapray utaare aur us khushkhabri ke sila mein us ko pehna diye Allah ki qasam ! us waqt mere paas wohi do kapray thay mein ne do kapray aariyatan liye aur un ko pehan kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se milnay ki niyyat se chala log mujh se giroh giroh miltay jatay thay aur mujhe maafi ki mubaarakbaad detay jatay thay aur kehtay thay tumharay liye Allah Taala ki maafi ki qubooliyat mubarak ho yahan tak ke mein masjid mein pahuncha to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid mein baithay thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas log thay aur Talha bin Ubaidullah raziyallahu anhu ne mujhe dekhtay hi daur kar aa kar mujh se musaafaha kiya aur mubaarakbaad di Allah ki qasam Muhajireen mein se un ke siwa koi shakhs khara nahi hua to Ka'b raziyallahu anhu Talha raziyallahu anhu ke us ehsaan ko nahi bhooltay thay Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko salam kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka chehra khushi se chamak damak raha tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke khush ho ja jab se teri maan ne tujh ko jana aaj ka din tere liye behtar din hai mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ye khushkhabri Aap ki taraf se hai ya Allah Jal Jalaluhu ki taraf se hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Jal Jalaluhu ki taraf se aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab khush ho jatay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka chehra chamak jata tha goya ke chaand ka aik tukra hai aur ham us baat (yani Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki khushi) ko pehchan letay thay jab mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay baitha to mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein apni maafi ki khushi mein apne maal ko Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye sadqa karta hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke apna thora maal rakh lo ye tumharay liye behtar hai mein ne arz kiya ke phir mein apna Khaibar ka hissa rakh leta hun aur mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! aakhir kaar sachayi ne mujhe nijaat di aur meri tauba mein ye bhi daakhil hai ke hamesha sach kahun ga jab tak zinda rahun Ka'b raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! mein nahi janta ke Allah Taala ne kisi Musalman par sach bolnay par aisa ehsaan kiya ho jab se mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ye zikr kiya jaisa umda tarah se mujh par ehsaan kiya Allah ki qasam ! jab se ye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaha us waqt se aaj ke din tak koi jhoot qasdan nahi bola aaj ke din tak aur mujhe umeed hai ke Allah Taala baaqi zindagi mein bhi mujhe jhoot se bachaye ga Ka'b ne kaha ke Allah Taala ne ye aayaat utaarein ” beshak Allah Taala ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Muhajireen aur Ansaar ko maaf kiya jinhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka muflisi ke waqt saath diya “ yahan tak ke farmaya ” wo meharban hai aur rehem wala hai aur Allah Taala ne un teen shakhson ko bhi maaf kiya jo peechay chhoray gaye yahan tak ke zameen un par bawajood apni kushaadgi ke tang ho gayi aur un ke nafs bhi tang ho gaye aur samjhay ke ab Allah Taala se koi bachao nahi magar usi ki taraf phir Allah ne un ko maaf kiya taake wo tauba karein beshak Allah Taala bakhshnay wala meharban hai Ae iman walo ! Allah Taala se daro aur sachon ke saath raho “ (Surah : Tauba : 119 - 117) Ka'b raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! Allah Taala ne jab se mujhe Islam ki hidayat di hai us se barh koi ehsaan mujh par nahi kiya jo mere qareeb itna bara ho ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se sach bol diya aur jhoot nahi bola warna tabah hota jaisay jhootay tabah hue aur Allah Taala ne jhooton ki jab wahi utari to aisi burayi bayan ki ke kisi (aur) ki na ki ho gi farmaya ke ” jab tum un ki taraf laut kar jao ge to anqareeb wo tumharay saamnay Allah ki qasamein khayein ge taake tum un se koi ta'arruz na karo sau tum un se i'raaz kar lo beshak wo napaak hain aur un ka thikana jahannam hai ye badla hai un ki kamayi ka wo tum se us liye qasamein khatay hain ke tum un se khush ho jao pas agar tum un se khush bhi ho jao to bhi Allah Taala un badkaaron se khush nahi ho ga “ Ka'b raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ham teenon ka muamla un logon se muakhkhar kiya gaya jin ka uzr Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne qabool kar liya tha jab unhon ne qasam khayi to un se bai'at ki aur un ke liye istighfar kiya aur hamein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne peechay daal rakha (yani hamara muqadma faisla peechay rakha) yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne faisla kiya usi sabab se Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ” maaf kiya un teenon ko jo peechay daalay gaye thay yahan tak ke un par zameen apni kushaadgi ke bawajood tang ho gayi “ aur us lafz (yani khullifu) se ye muraad nahi hai ke ham jihad se peechay reh gaye balke wohi muraad hai hamaray muqadma ka peechay rehna aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka peechay daal rakhna ba nisbat un logon ke jinhon ne qasam khayi aur uzr kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ke uzr ko qabool kar liya "
"1919","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum se pehli ummaton mein aik shakhs tha jis ne ninanway qatl kiye thay us ne poocha ke zameen ke logon mein sab se zyada aalim kaun hai logon ne aik raahib ke baaray mein bataya wo us ke paas gaya aur kaha ke us ne ninanway qatl kiye hain kiya us ke liye tauba hai raahib ne kaha ke nahi ! (teri tauba qabool na ho gi) to us ne us raahib ko bhi maar daalnay aur sau qatl pooray kar liye phir us ne logon se poocha ke zameen mein sab se zyada aalim kaun hai logon ne aik aalim ke baaray mein bataya (to wo us ke paas gaya) aur poocha ke us ne sau qatl kiye hain kiya us ke liye tauba hai wo bola ke haan hai aur tauba karnay se kaun si cheez maane hai to falan mulk mein ja aur wahan kuch log hain jo Allah Taala ki ibadat kartay hain to bhi ja kar un ke saath ibadat kar aur apne mulk mein mat ja ke wo bura mulk hai phir wo us mulk ki taraf chala jab aadha safar tay kar liya to us ko maut aa gayi ab azaab ke farishton aur rehmat ke farishton mein jhagra hua rehmat ke farishton ne kaha ke ye tauba kar ke sidq dil ke saath Allah ki taraf mutawajjah ho kar aa raha tha aur azaab ke farishton ne kaha ke us ne koi neki nahi ki aakhir aik farishta aadmi ki soorat bin kar aaya aur unhon ne us ko faisla karnay ke liye muqarrar kiya us ne kaha ke donon taraf ki zameen naapo aur jis mulk ke qareeb ho wo wahein ka hai sau unhon ne zameen ko naapa to unhon ne us zameen ko qareeb paya jis ka us ne irada kiya tha pas rehmat ke farishtay us ko le gaye Qatada ne kaha (rawi hadees) Hasan ne kaha ke ham se ye bhi bayan hua ke jab wo marnay laga to apne seena ke bal barha (taake us mulk se qareeb ho jaye) "
"1920","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs us se pehle tauba kar le ke sooraj Maghrib se tuloo ho to Allah Taala us ko maaf kar de ga (sooraj ke Maghrib se nikalnay ke baad tauba qabool na ho gi usi tarah maut ke farishton ko dekhnay ke waqt tauba qabool na ho gi aur na us ki wasiyat naafiz ho gi)"
"1921","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Allah Azza wa Jal apna haath raat ko phailata hai taake din ka gunahgaar tauba kar le aur din ko haath phailata hai taake raat ka gunahgaar tauba kar le yahan tak ke aaftab Maghrib ki taraf se niklay (yani us ke baad tauba nahi) "
"1922","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai agar tum gunah na karo to albatta Allah Taala tumhein fana kar de ga aur aisay logon ko paida karay ga jo gunah karein ge aur phir us se bakhshish maangein ge pas Allah Taala un ko bakhsh de ga (SubhanAllah Allah Maalik ke saamnay qasoor ka iqraar karna aur ma'zirat karna aur tauba karna aur maafi chaahna kaisi umda baat hai aur Maalik ko kitna pasand hai kisi buzurg ne kaha ke wo gunah mubarak hai jis ke baad maafi aur wo ibadat manhoos hai jis se ghuroor paida ho) "
"1923","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab Allah Taala makhlooqat ko bana chuka to apni kitab mein likha aur wo kitab us ke paas rakhi hai ke meri rehmat mere ghussa par ghalib hai "
"1924","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala ki sau rehmatein hain aik rehmat jinon aadmiyon janwaron aur keeron makoron mein utari hai usi aik rehmat ki wajah se wo aik doosray par meharbani kartay hain aur rehem kartay hain aur usi rehmat ki wajah se wehshi janwar apne bacha se mohabbat karta hai aur ninanway rehmatein Allah Taala ne utha rakhein hain jo apne bandon par qayamat ke din karay ga "
"1925","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : agar momin ko Allah Taala tayyar kardah saza (azaab) ka ilm ho jaye to koi jannat ki tama na karay aur agar kafir ko Allah Taala ki rehmat (ki wus'at) ka ilm ho jaye to koi us ki jannat se naaumeed na ho "
"1926","[AI-translation] ´Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas qaidi aaye to un mein se aik aurat (apna bacha) talaash kar rahi thi jab apna bacha paa liya to us ko utha liya aur pait se lagaya aur doodh pilanay lagi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham se farmaya ke tum kiya samajhtay ho ke ye aurat apne bacha ko aag mein daal de gi ham ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! wo kabhi na daal sakay gi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke albatta Allah Taala apne bandon par us se zyada meharban hai jitni ye aurat apne bachay par meharban hai "
"1927","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai wo kehti thin ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : miyaana roi karo aur (jo miyaana roi na ho sakay to) us ke qareeb raho aur khush raho us liye ke kisi ko us ka amal jannat mein na le jaye ga logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! aur na Aap ko Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aur na mujh ko magar ye ke Allah Taala mujhe apni rehmat se dhaanp le aur jaan lo ke Allah Taala ko wo amal bohat pasand hai jo hamesha kiya jaye agarchay thora ho "
"1928","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Qais raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Allah Jal Jalaluhu se zyada koi eeza ya takleef par sabr karnay wala nahi (bawajood ye ke har tarah ki qudrat rakhta hai) Allah ke saath log shirk kartay hain aur us ke liye beta batatay hain (halanke us ka koi beta nahi sab us ke ghulam hain) phir bhi wo un ko tandrusti deta hai rozi deta hai aur un ko (tamam nematein) deta hai "
"1929","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kisi ko apni tareef karna itna pasand nahi hai jitna Allah Taala ko pasand hai (kyunke wo tareef ke laiq hai aur sab mein aib maujood hain to tareef ke qaabil nahi hain) usi wajah se Allah Taala ne apni khud tareef ki aur Allah se zyada ghairat mand koi nahi hai usi liye Allah Taala ne fawaahish ko haraam qarar diya hai aur Allah Taala se zyada kisi ko uzr karna pasand nahi hai (yani Allah Taala ko ye bohat pasand hai ke gunahgaar banday us ke saamnay uzr karein aur apne gunah ki maafi chahein) usi wastay us ne kitab utari aur paighambaron ko bheja (aur tauba ki taleem ki) "
"1930","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala ghairat karta hai aur momin bhi ghairat karta hai aur Allah Taala ko us mein ghairat aati hai ke momin wo kaam karay jis ko Allah Taala ne us par haraam kiya "
"1931","[AI-translation] ´Safwan bin Mehraz kehtay hain ke` aik aadmi ne Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha ke tum ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se sargoshi ke baaray mein kiya suna hai (yani Allah Taala jo qayamat ke din apne banday se sargoshi karay ga) unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke momin qayamat ke din apne Maalik ke paas laya jaye ga yahan tak ke Maalik apna baazu us par rakh de ga aur us se us ke gunaahon ka iqraar karaye ga aur kahay ga ke to apne gunaahon ko pehchanta hai wo kahay ga ke Ae Rab ! mein pehchanta hun Rab farmaye ga ke mein ne un gunaahon ko duniya mein tujh par chhupa diya aur ab mein un ko aaj ke din tere liye bakhsh deta hun phir wo naikiyon ki kitab diya jaye ga aur kafir aur munafiqon ke liye to makhlooqat ke saamnay munaadi ho gi ke ye wo log hain jinhon ne Allah Taala par jhoot bola "
"1932","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham apne Rab ko qayamat ke din dekhein ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tumhein sooraj ko dekhnay mein shak parta hai theek dopahar ke waqt jab ke baadal bhi na ho sahaba ne kaha ke nahi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tumhein chaudhween raat ke chaand ko dekhnay mein takleef hoti hai jab us ke aagay baadal na ho sahaba ne kaha ke nahi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke pas qasam hai us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ! tumhein apne Rab ke deedaar mein koi shubha aur ikhtilaf ya takleef na ho gi magar jaisay sooraj ya chaand ko dekhnay mein (yani jaisay chaand sooraj ko dekhnay mein ishtibaah nahi hai waisay hi Allah Taala ko dekhnay mein ishtibaah na ho ga) phir haq Taala banday se hisab karay ga to kahay ga ke Ae falan ! mein ne tujhe izzat nahi di thi aur tujhe sardar nahi banaya tha aur tujhe tera jora nahi diya aur ghoron aur oonton ko tera taabe nahi kiya tha aur tujhe chhora ke to apni qaum ki sardari (siyaasat) karta tha aur chautha hissa leta tha to banda kahay ga ke sach hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haq Taala farmaye ga ke bhala tujhe maloom tha ke to mujh se milay ga pas banda kahay ga ke nahi Allah Taala farmaye ga ke ab ham bhi tujhe bhooltay hain (yani teri khabar na lein ge aur tujhe azaab se na bachaayein ge) jaisay to hamein bhoola phir Allah Taala doosray banday se hisab karay ga to kahay ga ke Ae falan ! bhala mein ne tujhe izzat nahi di thi aur tujhe sardar nahi banaya tha aur tujhe tera jora nahi diya tha aur ghoron aur oonton ko teer attabi nahi kiya tha aur tujhe chhora ke to apni qaum ki sardari (siyaasat) karta tha aur chautha hissa leta tha to banda kahay ga ke Ae mere Rab ! sach hai phir Allah Taala farmaye ga ke bhala tujhe maloom tha ke to mujh se milay ga to banda kahay ga ke nahi phir Allah Taala farmaye ga ke pas yaqeenan mein bhi ab tujhe bhala deta hun jaisay to mujhe duniya mein bhoola tha phir teesray banday se hisab karay ga aur us se bhi usi tarah kahay ga banda kahay ga ke Ae Rab ! mein tujh par iman laya aur teri kitab par aur tere Rasoolullahon par aur mein ne namaz padhi rozah rakha aur sadqa diya usi tarah apni tareef karay ga jahan tak us se ho sakay ga haq Taala farmaye ga ke dekh yeein tera jhoot khula jata hai Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir hukm ho ga ke ab ham tere upar gawah khara kartay hain banda apne ji mein soche ga ke kaun mujh par gawahi de ga phir us ke munh par mahar ho gi aur us ki raan gosht aur haddion ko bolnay ke liye kaha jaye ga us ki raan us ka gosht aur us ki haddiaan us ke aamaal ki gawahi dein gi aur ye gawahi us wastay ho gi taake usi ki zaat ki gawahi se us ka uzr baaqi na rahay aur ye shakhs munafiq yani jhoota Musalman ho ga aur usi par Allah Taala ghussa karay ga (aur pehle donon kafir thay maazAllah jab tak dil se khaalis Allah ke liye ibadat na ho to kuch faida nahi logon ko dikhanay ki niyyat se namaz ya rozah rakhna aur wabaal hai us se na karna behtar hai) "
"1933","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas baithay thay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam muskuraye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum jantay ho ke mein kis wastay muskuraya hun ham ne kaha ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob jantay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein banday ki us guftagu ki wajah se muskuraya hun jo wo apne Maalik se karay ga banda kahay ga ke Ae mere Maalik ! kiya to mujhe zulm se panah nahi de chuka hai (yani to ne waada kiya hai ke zulm na karun ga) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Taala jawab de ga ke haan ! ham zulm nahi kartay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir banda kahay ga ke mein kisi ki gawahi ko apne upar siwae apni zaat ke jaaiz nahi rakhta Allah Taala farmaye ga ke acha ! teri hi zaat ki gawahi tujh par aaj ke din kifayat karti hai aur kiraaman kaatibeen ki gawahi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir banda ke munh par mahar laga di jaye gi aur us ke aaza (haath paon) ko hukm ho ga ke bolo wo us ke saaray aamaal bol dein ge phir banda ko baat karnay ki ijazat di jaye gi to banda apne aaza (haath paon) se kahay ga ke challu door ho jao tum par Allah ki maar mein to tumharay liye jhagra karta tha (yani tumhara hi dozakh se bachana mujhe manzoor tha pas tum Aap hi gunah ka qarar kar chukay ab dozakh mein jao) "
"1934","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : aik shakhs ne kabhi koi neki nahi ki thi jab wo marnay laga to apne logon se bola ke (marnay ke baad) mujhe jala kar raakh kar dena phir aadhi raakh jungle mein ura dena aur aadhi samandar mein Allah ki qasam ! agar Allah mujhe paye ga to aisa azaab karay ga ke waisa azaab duniya mein kisi ko nahi karay ga jab wo shakhs mar gaya to logon ne aisa hi kiya Allah Taala ne jungle ko hukm diya to us ne sab raakh ikatthi kar di phir samandar ko hukm diya to us ne bhi ikatthi kar di phir Allah ne us shakhs se farmaya ke to ne aisa kyun kiya wo bola ke Ae Allah ! to khoob janta hai ke mein ne ye sirf tere darr ki wajah se kiya tha pas Allah Taala ne us ko bakhsh diya "
"1935","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne Rab se riwayat ki ke aik banda gunah kar baitha to kaha ke Ae Allah ! mera gunah bakhsh de Allah ne farmaya ke mere banday ne gunah kiya phir us ne jaan liya ke us ka aik Maalik hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur gunah par muakhaza karta hai phir us ne gunah kiya aur kaha ke Ae mere Maalik ! mera gunah bakhsh de Allah ne farmaya ke mere banda ne aik gunah kiya aur us ne ye jaan liya ke us ka aik Rab hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur gunah par muakhaza bhi karta hai phir us ne gunah kiya aur kaha ke Ae mere paalnay walay ! mera gunah bakhsh de Allah ne farmaya ke mere banday ne gunah kiya aur us ne ye jaan liya ke us ka aik Allah hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur gunah par muakhaza bhi karta hai Ae banday ! ab to jo chahay amal kar mein ne tujhe bakhsh diya (rawi hadees) Abdul Aala ne kaha ke mujhe yaad nahi ke ye ” ab jo chahay amal kar “ teesri baar farmaya ya chauthi baar farmaya "
"1936","[AI-translation] ´Abu Umama raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid mein thay aur ham log bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath baithay thay itnay mein aik shakhs aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein had ke kaam ko pahuncha hun mujhe had lagayie Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ye sun kar chup ho rahay us ne phir kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein ne had ka kaam kiya hai mujhe had lagayie Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chup ho rahay itnay mein namaz khari hui jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz se farigh ho kar chalay to wo shakhs bhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay chala aur mein bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay ye dekhnay ko chala ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us shakhs ko kiya jawab detay hain phir wo shakhs Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se mila aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein ne had ka kaam kiya hai mujhe had lagayie Abu Umama raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jis waqt to apne ghar se nikla tha to ne achi tarah se wuzu nahi kiya wo bola ke kyun nahi Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir to ne hamaray saath namaz padhi wo bola haan Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah ne teri had ko ya tere gunah ko bakhsh diya "
"1937","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab qayamat ka din ho ga to Allah Taala har aik Musalman ko aik Yahudi ya Nasraani de ga aur farmaye ga ke ye tera jahannam se chhutkaara hai "
